# Thesis experiment profiles must be committed (the profile audit test runs on every checkout).
!software/nn/src/experiments/thesis/profiles/
!software/nn/src/experiments/thesis/profiles/**/*.json
# Paraconsistent GA experiment profiles must be committed (same rationale).
!software/nn/src/experiments/paraconsistentGA/profiles/
!software/nn/src/experiments/paraconsistentGA/profiles/**/*.json
# Meeting01 experiment profiles must be committed (same rationale: profile_audit_gtest's
# ProfileDirectoryAudit walks this whole directory on every checkout). Without this,
# meeting01-loso.json -- the profile that defines the entire multi-week paper run -- was
# untracked and existed on one machine only.
!software/nn/src/experiments/meeting01/profiles/
!software/nn/src/experiments/meeting01/profiles/**/*.json
# Meeting01 result manifests (split, model selection with every candidate, winners, summaries):
# 02_/03_/04_/09_ read them, and without them a committed run cannot be post-processed again.
# The *.json rule above silently kept every one of them out until 2026-11-11.
!software/nn/results/meeting01*/**/*.json
# Thesis results (per-repetition summaries, winners.json, per-unit logs): the thesis tables are
# generated from them, so every committed table must be re-derivable from committed results.
# The *.json and *.log rules would otherwise keep the summaries and logs out without a word
# while the .csv and .done files beside them went in.
!software/nn/results/thesis/**/*.json
!software/nn/results/thesis/**/*.log
# ...and the trained weights (Phase 01 models/**/fold_<k>.bin), versioned at the user's request
# (2026-11-12) so a thesis number can be re-scored from the exact network that produced it.
!software/nn/results/thesis/**/*.bin
*.next
*.npz
# PyTorch parity test fixtures must be committed (CI has no torch to regenerate).
!software/nn/src/core/tensor/tests/fixtures/pytorch_refs.npz
!software/nn/src/core/models/lstm/tests/fixtures/lstm_ae_refs.npz
!software/nn/src/core/wavelet/tests/fixtures/pywt_refs.npz
!software/nn/src/core/optimizers/tests/fixtures/optimizer_refs.npz
!software/nn/src/core/layers/tests/fixtures/micro_network_refs.npz
!software/nn/src/core/layers/tests/fixtures/independent_refs.npz
software/nn/tags
software/nn/docs/Open_access_database_of_EEG_signals_recorded_durin.pdf
*.sqlite
documentation/06-BooksToRead/*.pdf
.opencode/node_modules
documentation/07-articlesProduced/meeting01/paper.pdf
documentation/08-lectures/fronteiras-bitnets-redes-pulso/apresentacao.pdf

